Multiple key=value pairs in one call set every named key; a key new to the frontmatter
is appended after the existing ones.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress sp=3
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-status: backlog
+status: in-progress
+sp: 3
 ---
 # My Plan
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=in-progress, sp=3
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: in-progress
sp: 3
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
